        "comments": "The assembly ucChlLemn1.hap1.1 is based on 282x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. The exact order and orientation of the contigs on chromosome 17 (1,397 ? 1,574 Kbp) are unknown. Three copies of chromosome 15 are present in the diploid assembly. A deletion is observed in haplotype 2 of chromosome 2 (2.226?3.586 Kbp)",
